{"root":"mere","ipa":"/me.rə/","core":"仅仅，只不过，仅仅是","pos":["虚词"],"scenes":["高频"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/me.rə/","zh":"仅仅，只不过","phrases":[{"t":"mereka yang tahu","zh":"那些知道的人"},{"t":"mere ke sana","zh":"去那里"},{"t":"mere kata","zh":"仅仅一句话"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia mere datang untuk melihat keadaan.","zh":"他仅仅是来看看情况。"},{"t":"Ini bukan mere masalah kecil.","zh":"这不仅仅是个小问题。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"mere","ipa":"/me.rə/","zh":"仅仅，只","phrase":{"t":"mere satu","zh":"仅仅一个"},"example":{"t":"Itu mere kebetulan.","zh":"那纯粹是巧合。"}},{"w":"bermere","ipa":"/bərˈme.rə/","zh":"仅仅包含，只是","phrase":{"t":"bermere saja","zh":"只是那样"},"example":{"t":"Tindakan itu bermere sandiwara.","zh":"那个行为不过是演戏而已。"}},{"w":"memere","ipa":"/məˈme.rə/","zh":"仅仅当作","phrase":{"t":"memere kata","zh":"仅仅当作说说"},"example":{"t":"Jangan memere ucapan ini sebagai main-main.","zh":"不要把这句话仅仅当成开玩笑。"}},{"w":"terere","ipa":"/tərˈme.rə/","zh":"无意中仅有","phrase":{"t":"terere ada","zh":"偶然仅仅存在"},"example":{"t":"Nama itu terere tercatat di sana.","zh":"那个名字只是偶然被记录在那里。"}},{"w":"kemeretan","ipa":"/kəməˈrɛ.tan/","zh":"单纯性，局限性","phrase":{"t":"kemeretan makna","zh":"意义的单一性"},"example":{"t":"Kemeretan itu membuat kalimat kurang jelas.","zh":"那种局限性使得句子不够清晰。"}},{"w":"pemere","ipa":"/pəˈme.rə/","zh":"把…看作仅此而已的人","phrase":{"t":"pemere masalah","zh":"把问题简单化的人"},"example":{"t":"Dia seorang pemere yang sering mengabaikan detail.","zh":"他是一个经常忽视细节的简单化看待者。"}},{"w":"pemerean","ipa":"/pəməˈrɛ.an/","zh":"简单化，单纯化","phrase":{"t":"pemerean masalah","zh":"问题的单纯化"},"example":{"t":"Pemerean masalah tidak akan menyelesaikan krisis.","zh":"把问题单纯化并不能解决危机。"}},{"w":"sedemere","ipa":"/sədəˈme.rə/","zh":"仅仅如此，那样简单","phrase":{"t":"sedemere itu","zh":"仅仅那样"},"example":{"t":"Kejadiannya tidak sedemere itu.","zh":"事情并没有那么简单。"}},{"w":"bermere-mere","ipa":"/bərˌme.rəˈme.rə/","zh":"仅仅泛泛而谈","phrase":{"t":"bermere-mere saja","zh":"只是随便说说"},"example":{"t":"Mereka bermere-mere tanpa hasil.","zh":"他们只是泛泛而谈而没有结果。"}},{"w":"memere-merekan","ipa":"/məˌme.rəˈmɛ.rə.kan/","zh":"视为什么都不是，轻